#: kwindecoration.cpp:63
msgid "Window Decoration"
msgstr "Venster Versiering"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:65
msgid ""
"Select the window decoration. This is the look and feel of both the window "
"borders and the window handle."
msgstr ""
"Kies die venster versiering. Hierdie is die kyk en gevoel van beide die "
"venster grense en die venster handvatsel."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:70
msgid "General Options (if available)"
msgstr "Algemeen Opsies (as beskikbaar)"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:74
msgid "Use custom titlebar button &positions"
msgstr "Gebruik pasmaak titelbar knoppie posisies"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:76
msgid ""
"The appropriate settings can be found in the \"Buttons\" Tab. Please note "
"that this option is not available on all styles yet!"
msgstr ""
"Die geskikte instellings kan wees gevind in Die \"Knoppies\" Oortjie. "
"Asseblief nota wat hierdie opsie is nie beskikbaar op alle style nog!"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:80
msgid "&Show window button tooltips"
msgstr "Vertoon venster knoppie sleutel-leidraad"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:82
msgid ""
"Enabling this checkbox will show window button tooltips. If this checkbox is "
"off, no window button tooltips will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie keuseblokkie sal vertoon venster knoppie sleutel-leidraad. "
"As hierdie keuseblokkie is af, nee venster knoppie sleutel-leidraad sal wees "
"vertoon."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:95
msgid "Titlebar Button Position"
msgstr "Titelbar Knoppie Posisie"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:100
msgid ""
"To add or remove titlebar buttons, simply <i>drag</i> items between the "
"available item list and the titlebar preview. Similarly, drag items within "
"the titlebar preview to re-position them."
msgstr ""
"Na voeg by of verwyder titelbar knoppies, eenvoudig <i>trek</i>"
" iteme tussen die beskikbaar item lys en die titelbar voorskou. Soortgelyk, "
"trek iteme binne in die titelbar voorskou Na re-position hulle."

