#: kwindecoration.cpp:458
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Manager Decoration</h1>This module allows you to choose the "
"window border decorations, as well as titlebar button positions and custom "
"decoration options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Venster Bestuurder Versiering</h1>"
"Hierdie module laat toe jy na kies die Venster grens versierings, as goed as "
"titelbar knoppie posisies en pasmaak Versiering opsies."

